      "text": "Deal {deal_number} of {deals} begins: {hand_size_dealt} cards to each player, {cards_set_aside} set aside unused. Seat {attacker_seat} attacks first and offers the trump suits."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "your hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "bout_counter == 0"
      },
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "fields": [
        "hand",
        "hand_count"
      ],
      "text": "Your hand for this deal:"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the offer",
      "when": {
        "calc": "bout_counter == 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == attacker_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Clubs+Diamonds",
          "Clubs+Hearts",
          "Clubs+Spades",
          "Diamonds+Hearts",
          "Diamonds+Spades",
          "Hearts+Spades"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "offer_pick"
      },
      "text": "You are the first attacker of deal {deal_number}. Offer two different suits; your opponent will pick one of them as trump for the whole deal."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the offer is made",
      "when": {
        "calc": "bout_counter == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[s for s in ['Clubs', 'Diamonds', 'Hearts', 'Spades'] if s in $offer_pick] if len([s for s in ['Clubs', 'Diamonds', 'Hearts', 'Spades'] if s in $offer_pick]) == suits_offered else ['Hearts', 'Spades']"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {attacker_seat} offers {offer} as trump."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the trump choice",
      "when": {
        "calc": "bout_counter == 0"
      },
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != attacker_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "game": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "trump_pick"
      },
      "text": "Pick one of the offered suits {offer} as trump for the whole of deal {deal_number}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the trump is set",
      "when": {
        "calc": "bout_counter == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trump",
            "value": {
              "calc": "$trump_pick if $trump_pick in offer else offer[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "trump_code",
            "value": {
              "calc": "suit_code_clubs if trump == 'Clubs' else (suit_code_diamonds if trump == 'Diamonds' else (suit_code_hearts if trump == 'Hearts' else suit_code_spades))"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Trump for deal {deal_number} is {trump}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "attack",
      "label": "the legal attacks",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attack_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == attacker_seat"
            },
            "key": "atk_opts",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[a for a in sorted(you.hand)] + ([a + '+' + b for a in sorted(you.hand) for b in sorted(you.hand) if int(a) // 10 == int(b) // 10 and int(a) < int(b)] if min(max_attack_cards, sum([p.hand_count for p in players if p.seat != you.seat])) >= 2 else []) + ([a + '+' + b + '+' + c for a in sorted(you.hand) for b in sorted(you.hand) for c in sorted(you.hand) if int(a) // 10 == int(b) // 10 and int(b) // 10 == int(c) // 10 and int(a) < int(b) and int(b) < int(c)] if min(max_attack_cards, sum([p.hand_count for p in players if p.seat != you.seat])) >= 3 else [])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "attack",
      "label": "the attack",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == attacker_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "atk_opts"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "atk"
      },
      "text": "Deal {deal_number}, bout {bout_counter} played so far, trump {trump}. You attack: choose 1 to {max_attack_cards} cards of one rank from your hand (card codes joined by +), never more than the defender holds."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "attack",
      "label": "the attack is placed",
      "when": {
        "prose": "Every card the attacker named is in the attacker's hand, all named cards share one rank, and there are between 1 and 3 of them, no more than the defender's hand_count."
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attack_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in players[attacker_seat - 1].hand if ('+' + c + '+') in ('+' + $atk + '+')]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == attacker_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c not in attack_cards]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {attacker_seat} attacks with {attack_cards}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "attack",
      "label": "the illegal attack is replaced",
      "when": {
        "calc": "len(attack_cards) == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attack_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in players[attacker_seat - 1].hand if int(c) == min([int(x) for x in players[attacker_seat - 1].hand])]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == attacker_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c not in attack_cards]"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The attack was not legal; seat {attacker_seat} attacks with its lowest card instead: {attack_cards}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "defence",
      "label": "the legal defences",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defence_ok",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defence_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "atk0",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(attack_cards + ['0', '0', '0'])[0]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "atk1",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(attack_cards + ['0', '0', '0'])[1]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "atk2",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(attack_cards + ['0', '0', '0'])[2]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != attacker_seat"
            },
            "key": "def_opts",
            "value": {
              "calc": "['TAKE'] + [x + ' beats ' + atk0 for x in sorted(you.hand) if len(attack_cards) == 1 and ((int(x) % 10 == int(atk0) % 10 and int(x) // 10 > int(atk0) // 10) or (int(x) % 10 == trump_code and int(atk0) % 10 != trump_code))] + [x + ' beats ' + atk0 + ', ' + y + ' beats ' + atk1 for x in sorted(you.hand) for y in sorted(you.hand) if len(attack_cards) == 2 and x != y and ((int(x) % 10 == int(atk0) % 10 and int(x) // 10 > int(atk0) // 10) or (int(x) % 10 == trump_code and int(atk0) % 10 != trump_code)) and ((int(y) % 10 == int(atk1) % 10 and int(y) // 10 > int(atk1) // 10) or (int(y) % 10 == trump_code and int(atk1) % 10 != trump_code))] + [x + ' beats ' + atk0 + ', ' + y + ' beats ' + atk1 + ', ' + z + ' beats ' + atk2 for x in sorted(you.hand) for y in sorted(you.hand) for z in sorted(you.hand) if len(attack_cards) == 3 and x != y and x != z and y != z and ((int(x) % 10 == int(atk0) % 10 and int(x) // 10 > int(atk0) // 10) or (int(x) % 10 == trump_code and int(atk0) % 10 != trump_code)) and ((int(y) % 10 == int(atk1) % 10 and int(y) // 10 > int(atk1) // 10) or (int(y) % 10 == trump_code and int(atk1) % 10 != trump_code)) and ((int(z) % 10 == int(atk2) % 10 and int(z) // 10 > int(atk2) // 10) or (int(z) % 10 == trump_code and int(atk2) % 10 != trump_code))]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "defence",
      "label": "the defence",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat != attacker_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "def_opts"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "dfn"
      },
      "text": "You defend against {attack_cards} (trump {trump}). Say TAKE to pick the attack cards up, or choose a defence that beats every attack card with a different card from your hand."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "defence",
      "label": "the defence is played",
      "when": {
        "prose": "The defender named exactly one different card from the defender's own hand for each card in attack_cards, and each named card beats its paired attack card: it is the same suit and of higher rank, or it is of the trump suit while the attack card is not."
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defence_ok",
            "value": {
              "calc": "$dfn != 'TAKE'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defence_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in players[2 - attacker_seat].hand if (c + ' beats') in $dfn] if defence_ok else []"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != attacker_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in you.hand if c not in defence_cards]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "defence_ok"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "the bout resolves",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat != attacker_seat"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand + attack_cards"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "not defence_ok"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} takes {attack_cards} into hand; seat {attacker_seat} attacks again."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard + attack_cards + defence_cards"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "defence_ok"
            },
            "text": "The defence holds: {defence_cards} beat {attack_cards}. All go to the discard and the defender attacks next."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attacker_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "3 - attacker_seat"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "defence_ok"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "hand_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(you.hand)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "bout_counter",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Hand sizes: seat 1 {players[0].hand_count}, seat 2 {players[1].hand_count}. Bouts this deal: {bout_counter}."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "attack_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "defence_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "the deal ends",
      "when": {
        "calc": "count(p.hand_count == 0 for p in players) > 0 or bout_counter >= max_bouts_per_deal or round_number >= max_rounds_total"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.hand_count > 0 and count(p.hand_count == 0 for p in players) == 1"
            },
            "key": "penalty",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand_count"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} is the durak and takes {value} penalty."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "count(p.hand_count == 0 for p in players) == 0 and you.hand_count > min([p.hand_count for p in players])"
            },
            "key": "penalty",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.hand_count - min([p.hand_count for p in players])"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} holds more cards and takes {value} penalty."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "deal_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "bout_counter",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The deal is over. Penalties: seat 1 {players[0].penalty}, seat 2 {players[1].penalty}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "after the deal",
      "when": {
        "calc": "deal_number > deals or round_number >= max_rounds_total"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "deal_number > deals or round_number >= max_rounds_total"
      },
      "rank_by": "0 - you.penalty",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final penalties (lower wins): Seat 1 {players[0].penalty}, Seat 2 {players[1].penalty}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 40,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "CARDS. There are {deck_size} cards: four suits (Clubs, Diamonds, Hearts, Spades), each with ranks 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, J (11), Q (12), K (13), A (14). A card is written as a code: rank*10 + suit code, with Clubs {suit_code_clubs}, Diamonds {suit_code_diamonds}, Hearts {suit_code_hearts}, Spades {suit_code_spades} (61 = 6 of Clubs, 144 = Ace of Spades). Suit order, used only to break ties, is Clubs, Diamonds, Hearts, Spades.\n\nBEATING. Once a trump suit is set, card X beats card Y if (a) X is the same suit as Y and of higher rank, or (b) X is a trump and Y is not. Nothing else beats.\n\nSTRUCTURE. The game has {deals} deals. Each round is one bout. There are at most {max_bouts_per_deal} bouts per deal and at most {max_rounds_total} rounds in total. Player 1 is the first attacker (the proposer) in deals 1 and 3. Player 2 is the first attacker in deals 2 and 4. The other player is the first defender (the chooser).\n\nSTARTING A DEAL (first bout of a deal only):\nS1. DEAL. All {deck_size} cards are shuffled once. Each player gets {hand_size_dealt} cards face down; only the owner sees their hand. The remaining {cards_set_aside} cards are set aside face down, unseen and unused this deal.\nS2. OFFER. The first attacker names two different suits. If the answer is not two different suits, the offer is Hearts and Spades. The offer is announced to both players.\nS3. CHOICE. The first defender picks one of the two offered suits. That suit is trump for the whole deal and is announced. If the answer is not one of the offered suits, the first suit offered becomes trump.\n\nA BOUT (every round), in order:\n1. ATTACK. The attacker places {min_attack_cards} to {max_attack_cards} cards from their hand face up. All must be the same rank, and their number may not exceed the number of cards in the defender's hand. If the attack is legal it stands. An illegal attack (a card not in hand, mixed ranks, or too many cards) is replaced by the attacker's single lowest-ranked card; ties go to the earliest suit in suit order. The attack is announced.\n2. DEFENCE. The defender either says TAKE, or names one different card from their hand for each attack card, saying which attack card each one beats. Every pairing must be a legal beat. If it is, the defence succeeds; any illegal or incomplete defence counts as TAKE.\n3. RESOLVE. If the defence succeeded, all attack and defence cards are discarded face up, out of play, and the defender becomes the attacker for the next bout. If the defender took, the attack cards go into the defender's hand and the same player attacks again next bout. All cards played, the result, and both hand sizes are announced. The bout counter rises by 1.\n\nENDING A DEAL. After RESOLVE, the deal ends if either player has no cards or the bout counter has reached {max_bouts_per_deal}. Penalties:\n- If exactly one player has no cards, the other player (the durak) adds the number of cards in their hand to their penalty total.\n- If both have no cards, nobody scores.\n- If the deal ended at {max_bouts_per_deal} bouts with both holding cards, the player with more cards adds the difference in hand sizes to their penalty total. Equal hands score nothing.\nThe next deal then starts with its bout counter at 0 and the first attacker set by the schedule above.\n\nENDING THE GAME. The game ends when deal {deals} has ended. If round {max_rounds_total} finishes during a deal, that deal is scored as if it had reached its {max_bouts_per_deal}-bout cap. The player with the lower total penalty wins. If the two totals are equal, the game is a draw (both share the win)."
}
